{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","林中决斗"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","森での決闘"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","选择累计造成伤害最高的敌人，将其踢至空旷区域开启决斗。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","合計与ダメージが最も高い敵を選択し、対象を空いているエリアまで蹴飛ばして決闘を始める"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","蕾米雅选择累计造成伤害最高的敌人，冲刺至目标附近进行飞踢造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，并将目标延直线击退至一个较空旷的区域，随后再次冲刺到目标身前进行第二次飞踢造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，每次飞踢还会眩晕目标2秒，在这个过程中蕾米雅处于霸体状态。落地后与目标开启“决斗”，持续12秒，在此期间双方优先以对方为攻击目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","合計与ダメージが最も高い敵を選択してその近くまで突進し、キックで対象に200% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、空いているエリアに向けて一直線に後退させる。その後、もう一度対象の近くまで突進し、再びキックで対象に200% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間のスタンを付与。その間、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。着地後の12秒間、対象と「決闘」を行う。決闘期間中、自身と対象はお互いを優先的に攻撃する"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":90,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":112,"end":118,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":86,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":127,"end":129,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":108,"end":122,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":149,"end":157,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","蹴飛ばしの与ダメージが210% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","蹴飛ばしの与ダメージが220% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","蹴飛ばしの与ダメージが230% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","蹴飛ばしの与ダメージが240% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","凌空一击"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","ジャンプアタック"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","可免疫敌人的普通攻击并反制敌人，还能施展旋风腿造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵の通常攻撃を無効化し、反撃する。さらに、回転キックで敵に範囲ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当受到来自蕾米雅攻击目标的普通攻击伤害时，若目标在自身附近1格范围，则免疫本次伤害并立即踢向目标，造成260% + 25% ATK伤害和2秒眩晕，该效果至多每6秒触发一次，施法期间处于霸体状态。主动释放时，倒立旋转腿部对周围1格范围内的敌人造成3次110% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃対象からの通常攻撃によるダメージを受けた時、その対象が自身の周囲1マス範囲内にいる場合、そのダメージを無効化し、キックで対象に260% + 25% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間のスタンを付与。この効果は6秒ごとに1回まで発動可能。発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。アクティブ効果：逆さまになって回転キックを繰り出し、周囲1マス範囲内の敵に110% ATKのダメージを3回与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":92,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":124,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":128,"end":136,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":179,"end":187,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至120% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが120% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至125% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが125% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至130% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが130% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","掠影腿技"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","シャドウキック"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升暴击，当普通攻击暴击时，追加一次超级踢腿造成伤害和眩晕。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","クリティカルがUP。通常攻撃がクリティカルした時、スーパーキックを1回発動し、敵にダメージを与え、スタンを付与"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","蕾米雅提升15点暴击，每当自身普通攻击暴击时，立即追加一次超级踢腿，造成1秒眩晕和200% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","自身のクリティカル+15。自身の通常攻撃がクリティカルした時、直ちにスーパーキックを1回追加し、対象に200% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、1秒間のスタンを付与"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","超级踢腿的伤害提高至210% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","スーパーキックのダメージが210% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}